{"game": "aliens-fireteam-elite", "language": "english", "appid": 1549970, "month": "2024-06", "window": 2, "start_date": 1717804800, "end_date": 1718495999, "month_true_total": 86, "quota": 5, "returned": 5, "pulled_at": "2026-09-04 02:23:36 Pacific Daylight Time", "reviews": [{"recommendationid": "167412009", "author": {"steamid": "76561198247278640", "personaname": "Alien_inside", "persona_status": "offline", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/profiles/76561198247278640/", "num_games_owned": 0, "num_reviews": 18, "playtime_forever": 3730, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 3686, "last_played": 1730033532, "avatar": "0f27661f01830d7f4efa5cf92e646d8f279a7f20"}, "language": "english", "review": "too bad they focus on cosmetics not new areas", "timestamp_created": 1718452336, "timestamp_updated": 1718452336, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 0, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": 0.5, "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": true, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1629777600", "reactions": []}, {"recommendationid": "167367175", "author": {"steamid": "76561199140877297", "personaname": "SmartyTheAstarte", "persona_status": "offline", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/profiles/76561199140877297/", "num_games_owned": 0, "num_reviews": 5, "playtime_forever": 1551, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 5, "playtime_at_review": 368, "last_played": 1788263476, "avatar": "5b8c6669a9d87a337d9b7a1a89fdb3f7f3fb4e43"}, "language": "english", "review": "Bought it on sale for 9 Bucks. Hopped on with a friend, played for 6 hours straight, we had a blast. Gonna play it tomorrow to.  Lore is optional, but good, the gunplay feels smooth, the classes are more or less balanced. Havent finished it yet, but I plan on doing so. It took us about 5 hours to get through roughly half of the content (though we used a sort of modifyer, that made the game harder, but gave us better rewards), just to give you an idea of the longevity of the game. In the 6 hours of playing, we encountered one game braking bug. I was incapable of shooting, sprinting, reloading or reviving my teammate and had to be knocked down and revived twice to get it fixed (that set us back 20 minutes). Thats all the Critique I have. The game was most definetly worth my money and my time. Now if you read this after the sale has ended the price is probaply back up to 30 bucks. If that is a fair price for the game, that is for you to decide.", "timestamp_created": 1718397953, "timestamp_updated": 1718397953, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 22, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": "0.729125380516052246", "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": true, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1629777600", "reactions": [{"reaction_type": 4, "count": 1}]}, {"recommendationid": "167360942", "author": {"steamid": "76561198067579208", "personaname": "Nekro Silver", "persona_status": "offline", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/profiles/76561198067579208/", "num_games_owned": 0, "num_reviews": 193, "playtime_forever": 2761, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 1648, "last_played": 1786507296, "avatar": "7ce5e894b9e61b70a0e5c38324693708d5b85f12"}, "language": "english", "review": "great if you buy it on sale. I bought it for $8.99 USD. I loved it so much I bought the playable DLC.  and you get a lot extra stuff that's better then any cosmetic packs. that alone is worth it. plus new aliens to kill! with 3 more missions is good enough w/ the high replay value of this game. and the devs keep updating the game. well done, thank you Devs...\n", "timestamp_created": 1718391699, "timestamp_updated": 1718391699, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 0, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": 0.5, "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": true, "received_for_free": false, "refunded"